title: "scptseq: software for Allele-resolved CRISPR editing and splicing outcomes with their transcriptional consequences in vivo"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: "scptseq calls CRISPR-induced mutations, including deletions, insertions, substitutions and splicing changes, per cell and per haplotype near targeted cut sites in scPT-seq data."
